flowchart TB
    A[AI Feature] --> B{Does AI commit a business outcome?}

    B -- No, informational --> C[Allow as Assistant or Recommendation]
    B -- Yes --> D{Is deterministic validation available?}

    D -- Yes --> E[AI Suggests, System Commits]
    D -- No --> F[Human Review or Keep Outside Critical Path]

    C --> G[Record Prompt, Evidence, Model Version]
    E --> H[Record Evidence, Decision, Policy Version]
    F --> I[Escalate or Defer]

    G --> J[Replayable AI Capability]
    H --> J
    I --> J
